+                      threadblock_offset.column() * kInterleavedK,
+                      threadblock_offset.row() / kInterleavedK)) {}
+
+  /// Construct a PredicatedTileAccessIterator with zero threadblock offset
+  CUTLASS_HOST_DEVICE
